This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).
It merges ten tools previously developed as separate projects (sentry2otlp,
otlp2loki-preview, otlp-prom-namecheck, tracepack, spanmetrics-offline,
promdiff-guard, tailsim, promcard-trim, alert-flapsim and tracediff); tracepack,
alert-flapsim and tracediff were originally Node.js tools and are included as
Python ports. otelwrench is an independent interoperability project and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by OpenTelemetry, the Cloud Native Computing
Foundation, Prometheus, Grafana Labs (Loki), Sentry, Jaeger or Zipkin. Product
names only identify interoperable file formats. No upstream implementation code
is included. See THIRD_PARTY.md for per-command attribution.

