-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
otelwrench sentry (formerly sentry2otlp)

Original interoperability implementation of public Sentry SDK envelope and
OpenTelemetry Protocol JSON formats. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Sentry
or OpenTelemetry. No upstream implementation code is included.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
otelwrench loki (formerly otlp2loki-preview)

Original offline interoperability implementation. OpenTelemetry and Grafana
Loki names identify the formats being inspected; this project is not affiliated
with or endorsed by their maintainers. No Loki/Grafana/Mimir AGPL or Sentry
server FSL implementation is included. Dependency license texts (PyYAML,
google-re2) are supplied in licenses/.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
otelwrench tailsim (formerly tailsim)

Original offline interoperability implementation. OpenTelemetry is a
format/configuration reference; this tool is not endorsed by or part of
OpenTelemetry. The MIT license for PyYAML is preserved in
licenses/PyYAML-MIT.txt. The optional LibYAML component in PyYAML wheels is MIT
licensed; see licenses/LibYAML-MIT.txt.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
otelwrench promdiff (formerly promdiff-guard), otelwrench prom-names (formerly
otlp-prom-namecheck), otelwrench cardinality (formerly promcard-trim),
otelwrench spanmetrics (formerly spanmetrics-offline), otelwrench tracepack,
otelwrench tracediff, otelwrench alert-flapsim and otelwrench preflight (new in
otelwrench; it combines promdiff, prom-names and cardinality)

Original interoperability implementations. Prometheus, OpenTelemetry, Jaeger
and Zipkin are format and behavioral references; no upstream implementation
code is incorporated.
